{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"041bfa209c1bd8138686a87c00c5325476bd6721f47866508098b9a4f8ea9feb","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1290},"chapter":{"number":17,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["神要刑罚亚兰和以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["论大马士革的默示：",{"text":"看哪，大马士革已被废弃，不再为城，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必变作乱堆。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚罗珥的城邑已被撇弃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必成为牧羊之处；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"羊在那里躺卧，无人惊吓。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲不再有保障；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大马士革不再有国权；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚兰所剩下的","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必像以色列人的荣耀消灭一样。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是万军之耶和华说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"到那日，雅各的荣耀必至枵薄；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他肥胖的身体必渐瘦弱。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就必像收割的人收敛禾稼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用手割取穗子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又像人在利乏音谷拾取遗落的穗子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其间所剩下的不多，好像人打橄榄树—","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在尽上的枝梢上只剩两三个果子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在多果树的旁枝上只剩四五个果子。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是耶和华—以色列的 神说的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["当那日，人必仰望造他们的主，眼目重看以色列的圣者。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他们必不仰望祭坛，就是自己手所筑的，也不重看自己指头所做的，无论是木偶是日像。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["在那日，他们的坚固城必像树林中和山顶上所撇弃的地方，就是从前在以色列人面前被人撇弃的。这样，地就荒凉了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"因你忘记救你的 神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不记念你能力的磐石；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，你栽上佳美的树秧子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"插上异样的栽子。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"栽种的日子，你周围圈上篱笆，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又到早晨使你所种的开花；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但在愁苦极其伤痛的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所收割的都飞去了。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["敌国都被击败"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"text":"唉！多民哄嚷，好像海浪匉訇；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦奔腾，好像猛水滔滔；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列邦奔腾，好像多水滔滔；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但 神斥责他们，他们就远远逃避，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又被追赶，如同山上的风前糠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如暴风前的旋风土。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["到晚上有惊吓，未到早晨他们就没有了。这是掳掠我们之人所得的分，是抢夺我们之人的报应。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/17.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/18.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/ISA/16.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}